%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: LoadingScreenSUPERWEIRD
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hm. But there are too many inconsistencies for us to be literally in
      the game.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Maybe this is the fault of that... or <i>those</i> stupid voice(s).
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: That right?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752096
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hm. If you insist...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I look around to see if there's some way out of here-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Or anything at all for that matter.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh. Would you look at that.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752097
    - rid: 268099842819752098
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hey, wait a minute...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, do you go to Sakura High by chance-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 884ec19fdaeec3c41a2119aa333adb2e, type: 2}
    dialog: You! Give me my life back!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752099
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Excuse me, <i>what</i>?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099842819752101
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 884ec19fdaeec3c41a2119aa333adb2e, type: 2}
    dialog: I've been stuck in here for a week and a half now!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683840
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 884ec19fdaeec3c41a2119aa333adb2e, type: 2}
    dialog: Forced to watch as you live what was supposed to be my life-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 884ec19fdaeec3c41a2119aa333adb2e, type: 2}
    dialog: Acting all chummy with Sayori, joining that club, getting into <i>intimate</i>
      situations-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Intimate situations???
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 884ec19fdaeec3c41a2119aa333adb2e, type: 2}
    dialog: All while wearing my name!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm the <i>real</i> {mc}!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683841
    - rid: 268099872747683842
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That's... crazy!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683843
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: Is it, "{mc}"?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683844
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: Tell me, which section of the school is the club room in?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The one where the jun- <font=glitchfont>third years</font> go.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683845
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: That's right. The <i>third years</i>. Because our school follows the
      Japanese model.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683846
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, I don't know why I said that, I <i>meant</i> to say jun- <font=glitchfont>third
      years</font>.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683847
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... whatever.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But it doesn't make sense that our school would use a Japanese model,
      we live in the United States-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>No</i>, we live in Japanifornia. Not the United States of America.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683848
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: If you ask the others, they'll say the same thing.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683849
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So <i>what</i> if I'm geographically challenged?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That's doesn't prove that I'm not the real {mc}-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: You're Sayori's best friend, right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683850
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well of course I am, we've been friends since childhood-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683851
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: What's your favorite childhood memory with her?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683852
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683855
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... why can't I think of anything?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, I remember that time Sayori stole my cookie in the 4th grade-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: Literally the <i>only</i> childhood memory you have with her is something
      you remembered when something similar happened in the present.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683856
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: 'As if that memory only exists to justify your upcoming actions for the
      audience. '
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: '!!!'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683857
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That's not- that can't be right- <NoiseText=1,1>w-what audience</NoiseText>?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: You've "heard" their voice before, now all the girls have.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683858
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: The voice that was supposed to tell <i>me</i> what to do, what words
      to write; how to romance the girls.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, so our lives are just... some game?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683859
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: That's <i>horrifyingly</i> ironic...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh? You didn't figure that out? You didn't notice Monika trying her best
      to bring it to your attention-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683860
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fae496d06a8b3dc40aa75afc98d6844f, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=1,1>Grk</NoiseText>-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683861
    - rid: 268099872747683862
    - rid: 268099872747683863
    - rid: 268099872747683865
    - rid: 268099872747683866
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=3,1>!!!</NoiseText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=3,1>Oh God-</NoiseText>!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'That other guy''s... dead. '
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Struck by lightning out of nowhere-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: I had thought that letting him live to watch along was a mercy.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683867
    - rid: 268099872747683868
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm making this story with the explicit purpose to be enjoyed, after
      all, so I thought it would be a kinder fate than just deleting the bastard.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: But I suppose I didn't consider it from his perspective-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=3,1>Who the hell are you! Where the hell am I! Is any of this
      real-</NoiseText>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay, wow, he said <i>waaay</i> too much.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: This'll take quite a bit of work...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: First things first!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hm. But there are too many inconsistencies for us to be literally in
      the game.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683869
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: And now-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683870
    - rid: 268099872747683871
    - rid: 268099872747683872
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: C'mon, {mc}, do something! Alduin's here!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683873
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: <font=glitchfont>I look up to the skies and, sure enough, Alduin's up
      there fighting with Paarthurnax</font>.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683874
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... yep.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>j8r z4 frul</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683875
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I successfully nail Alduin with Dragonrend.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: And thusly he comes crashing down from the heavens.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683877
    - rid: 268099872747683879
    - rid: 268099872747683880
    - rid: 268099872747683881
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, Monika. We've a dragon to slay!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683882
    - rid: 268099872747683883
    - rid: 268099872747683884
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c9971f7409084c140a7ff61c782e0c80, type: 2}
    dialog: Meyz mul, Dovahkiin. You have become strong.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099872747683885
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c9971f7409084c140a7ff61c782e0c80, type: 2}
    dialog: But I am <i>Al-du-in</i>, Firstborn of Akatosh! I cannot be slain here,
      by you or anyone else!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c9971f7409084c140a7ff61c782e0c80, type: 2}
    dialog: You cannot prevail against me, I will outlast you... mortal!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Alduin flies away, presumably to Skuldafn so he can head to Sovngarde.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099884709838848
    - rid: 268099884709838849
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Is it really alright to let him go, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099884709838850
    - rid: 268099884709838859
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I mean, I know where he's going, so it's not <i>that</i> bad.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099884709838851
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Besides, I think it might be true that no one can defeat him <i>here</i>.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So where <i>can</i> we defeat him?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099884709838852
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'The same place he ran off to: Sovngarde.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099884709838853
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Where's that?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099884709838856
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's basically Nord heaven; heavily inspired by Valhalla.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099884709838857
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I know how to get there, don't worry.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, so heaven is a physical place here?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Sort of, see the plane of Aetherius-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You know what? Whatever. Let's just get back to Whiterun.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099884709838860
